Locke's Airlocks
================
Based on Blargmode's Aggressive Airlocks. Full attribution at
https://github.com/Pyurah/se-lockes-airlock/blob/main/CREDITS.md

SETUP
-----
Press Ok / Run once to initialize. Run "update" after any block changes.
Check Custom Data for all settings and the setup log.

TAGS (add to block Custom Name)
--------------------------------
  #AL       Outer door of a smart or group airlock
  #Hangar   Outer door of a hangar
  #Ignore   Exclude this block entirely
  #Manual   Disable auto-close on this door

COMMANDS (as Run argument)
---------------------------
  update    Re-scan all blocks
  atmo      Toggle atmosphere mode
  atmo on   Force atmosphere mode on
  atmo off  Force atmosphere mode off

See README at the GitHub link above for full setup instructions.
